              <h3>How Composio was used — and where I fell back</h3>
              <p class="headline-text" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
                Whether each app already has a Composio toolkit comes from the public Composio catalog (1,843 toolkits) — looked up by name, not guessed by a model.
              </p>
              <p class="headline-text">
                I intended search and page-fetch to run through Composio’s tool layer. The provided consumer key could not authenticate those calls, so I switched the agent to the same search and fetch tools directly, with on-disk caching ({{ run1.totals.tool_calls }} research calls, {{ run2.totals.tool_calls }} re-research calls during verification).
              </p>
